# Kocaeli Social Hub
#
# The site is fully static. It needs NO environment variables and NO API keys.
# There is nothing to configure to run, build or deploy it.
#
# The two build-time variables below are OPTIONAL. Both fall back to a default
# when unset, so a plain `npm ci && npm run build:static` works with no
# environment at all.
#
# APP_BASE
#   Base path when the site is served from a subpath.
#   Default: /
#   Example: /kocaeli-social-hub/
#
# SITE_ORIGIN
#   Absolute origin (scheme + host) used for canonical URLs, og:url, the
#   sitemap and the RSS feed.
#   Default: inferred at build time
#   Example: https://example.com
